<task id="cat_AddingAndEditingCategories" xml:lang="en-us" class="- topic/topic task/task "><title class="- topic/title ">Adding and editing a basic category</title><shortdesc class="- topic/shortdesc ">You add and edit basic categories using the <wintitle class="+ topic/keyword ui-d/wintitle ">Category
