Manager</uicontrol></menucascade>.</cmd><stepresult class="- topic/itemgroup task/stepresult ">The <wintitle class="+ topic/keyword ui-d/wintitle ">Category Manager</wintitle> view opens.<p class="- topic/p ">The rows in the <wintitle class="+ topic/keyword ui-d/wintitle ">Category Manager</wintitle> view represent existing categories.</p></stepresult></step><step class="- topic/li task/step "><cmd class="- topic/ph task/cmd ">Do one of the following:</cmd><choices class="- topic/ul task/choices "><choice class="- topic/li task/choice ">To edit the name or index of an existing category, double-click
