categories.</stepresult></step><step class="- topic/li task/step "><cmd class="- topic/ph task/cmd ">Enter a name and an index for each category and click <uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">OK</uicontrol>.</cmd><stepresult class="- topic/itemgroup task/stepresult ">The name(s) replace the default “Category 1,”
“Category 2”, etc. names.</stepresult></step></steps></taskbody></task>